Package: ASW
Type: Package
Title: Clustering by Optimising the Average Silhouette Width
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Minh Long",
                  family = "Nguyen",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "edelweiss611428@gmail.com")
Description: Exact and computationally efficient algorithms for clustering by
    maximising the Average Silhouette Width (Rousseeuw, 1987). Provides the 
    'OSil' and 'FOSil' algorithms of Batool and Hennig (2021) and the 'PAMSil' 
    algorithm of Van der Laan et al. (2003), together with 'effOSil' and
    'scalOSil', which return the same clusterings as 'OSil' and 'FOSil'
    respectively at a fraction of the computational cost.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/edelweiss611428/ASW
BugReports: https://github.com/edelweiss611428/ASW/issues
